Note on third-party binaries:

Hörbuchklöppler invokes the external command-line tools `ffmpeg` and
`mediainfo` at runtime. These are NOT included in this repository. The build
script downloads them from their official upstream sources:

  - ffmpeg    — https://evermeet.cx/ffmpeg/  (licensed under the GPL)
  - mediainfo — https://mediaarea.net/en/MediaInfo  (BSD-2-Clause)

ffmpeg is licensed under the GNU General Public License. It is used here as a
separate, unmodified executable invoked via a subprocess; it is not linked
into this application. Because the binaries are fetched by the user from the
official upstream (which already provides the corresponding source), they are
not redistributed by this project. See docs/dependencies.md for details.
